---
layout: base.njk
section: secret
title: "Dev Blog"
description: "Notes from building Healthcare Uncharted: what we figured out, what broke, content ideas, and the feedback we heard, with a record of what came of it."
navPage: secret
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- THE DEV BLOG's front page (2026-10-11). Secret menu only (noindex, out of every collection). The posts and the
    feedback rows come from src/_data/devBlog.js; each post is its own page in this folder. -#}
{% include "components/blog-style.njk" %}

<div class="blog hu-read">
  <header class="blog-hero"><div class="hu-read-hero-inner">
    <div class="hu-read-eyebrow">Secret Menu &middot; Dev Blog</div>
    <h1 class="hu-read-h1">Dev Blog</h1>
    <p class="hu-read-standfirst">Notes from building this site. What we figured out, what broke, ideas for what comes next,
    and what people told us, with a running record of whether their feedback changed anything.</p>
  </div></header>

  <div class="hu-read-body">

    <section class="hu-read-section" id="posts">
      <div class="hu-read-kicker">Posts</div>
      <h2 class="hu-read-h2">Every post, newest first</h2>
      <ul class="blog-list">
        {%- for p in devBlog.posts %}
        <li><a class="blog-post" href="/secret-menu/blog/{{ p.slug }}/">
          <span class="k">Post {{ p.n }} &middot; <time datetime="{{ p.date }}">{{ p.dateText }}</time></span>
          <span class="t">{{ p.title }}</span>
          <span class="d">{{ p.summary }}</span>
        </a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="hu-read-section" id="feedback">
      <div class="hu-read-kicker">Feedback</div>
      <h2 class="hu-read-h2">The feedback tracker</h2>
      <ul class="blog-tally">
        <li><b>{{ devBlog.totals.heard }}</b>heard</li>
        <li><b>{{ devBlog.totals.done }}</b>done</li>
        <li><b>{{ devBlog.totals.planned }}</b>planned</li>
        <li><b>{{ devBlog.totals.not }}</b>not doing</li>
      </ul>
      {%- set fbRows = devBlog.all %}{% set fbLinkPosts = true %}
      {% include "components/blog-feedback.njk" %}
    </section>

  </div>
</div>
